{
  "dom_id": "step-39343",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Calculating the Variance of a Sum or Difference of Random Variables",
  "problem": "For two random variables $X$ and $Y,$ we have $\\textrm{Var}[X] = 3,$ $\\textrm{Var}[Y] = 0.24,$ and $\\textrm{Cov}[X,Y] = 0.2.$ Determine $\\textrm{Var}[X-Y].$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are random variables, then\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[X \\pm Y] = \\textrm{Var}[X] + \\textrm{Var}[Y] \\pm 2\\textrm{Cov}[X,Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given data into the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[X - Y] = 3 + 0.24 - 2 \\cdot 0.2 = 2.84.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-39343\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"39343\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"10435\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-39343\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Calculating the Variance of a Sum or Difference of Random Variables</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"39343\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\